      "mergeID": "63706eab5560d354691200df",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The current wrist adjustment model only allows for the wrists to be rotated on the x-axis (if being shown a t-posed model). Some controllers, like VIVE wands, also have issues with y-axis offsets. There may be VR controllers in the future supported by SteamVR that may also have this issue. Please allow for y-axis adjustments too.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1260 FEEDBACK] Please allow for wrist adjustment on the Y-axis",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "636fc3fba337de4cbc4f725f",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've made a more detailed post with some screenshots describing the issue here https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-ik-20/p/option-to-modify-wrist-positional-offset-values",
      "viewerReactions": null,
