      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If the amount of menu items is a problem, can always use an accordion component to convert 6 sliders into 1 very specific item altogether.\nI understand nesting options in components like this adds complexity to the menu, but there's a difference between throwing various things together or just specific things which all affect the same area.\nFor example having 6 toggles for various unrelated things makes navigation very confusing but getting 6 sliders that all modify the same component makes sense like literally \"controller position\" clears space and it's not confusing.\n(material-ui react.js component as example)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
